<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3905/10  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7291/96  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9446/56  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4408/13  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.65/69   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8300/20  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1689.2/0.7 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     115.29/39  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7006/81  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.2434/84  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5833/53  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6538/48</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$337.25/75</p>
</text>
